  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　えだを　ひらいて　えものをのみこむ。　せいきを　ぞんぶんにすいとると　はきだして　すてるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 가지를 열어서 먹이를 삼킨다. 생기를 실컷 흡수한 다음 그대로 뱉어 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會張開頭的樹枝吞沒獵物。把精氣吸得淋漓盡致後，就會吐出來丟掉。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il déplie ses branches pour gober ses proies. Une fois qu’il a absorbé la quantité d’énergie vitale qu’il souhaitait, il les recrache.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es öffnet die Zweige auf dem Kopf, um Beute zu verschlingen. Hat es dieser genug Lebensenergie entzogen, spuckt es sie aus und entsorgt sie so.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despliega las ramas para engullir a sus presas. Cuando ha terminado de absorber su energía vital, las escupe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apre i rami del volto per ingoiare la preda. Dopo averne assorbito forza vitale a sufficienza, la sputa fuori.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It will open the branches of its head to envelop its prey. Once it absorbs all the life energy it needs, it expels the prey and discards it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　枝を　開いて　獲物を飲みこむ。　生気を　存分に吸い取ると　吐き出して　捨てるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "张开头部的枝条来吞食猎物。在尽情吸食精气之后，就会把猎物吐出来扔掉。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despliega las ramas para engullir a sus presas. Cuando ha terminado de absorber su energía vital, las escupe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かんそうちたいを　ほうろうする。ごくまれに　！\u0004\t大量発生たいりょうはっせい大量発生してまちひとつを　うめつくしてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "건조 지대를 떠돈다. 매우 드물지만 대량발생하여 마을 전체를 뒤덮어 버릴 때도 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會在乾燥地帶流浪。有極低的機率會大量出現，把一整座城鎮塞得滿滿滿。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ces Pokémon errent à travers les régions arides. En de très rares occasions, ils apparaissent en masse et peuvent engloutir une ville entière.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese Pokémon durchstreifen Trockenzonen. In sehr seltenen Fällen treten sie massenhaft auf und begraben eine ganze Stadt unter sich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Suele deambular por zonas áridas. En muy raras ocasiones, aparecen en masa y llegan a sepultar un pueblo entero.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vaga per zone aride. In rarissime occasioni, una sua comparsa massiccia può seppellire una città intera.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Brambleghast wanders around arid regions. On rare occasions, mass outbreaks of these Pokémon will bury an entire town.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
